opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Validated values, confidence gates, and per-value freshness"
description:
  "A small typed-state library for validated and trusted values, explicit trust transitions, exhaustive confidence levels, and monotonic per-value TTL freshness. Its abstract types carry checked state without claiming linearity or lifetime guarantees that standard OCaml cannot enforce."
maintainer: "Stephen Olesen <slepp@slepp.ca>"
authors: "Stephen Olesen <slepp@slepp.ca>"
license: "MIT OR Apache-2.0"
